# Wasp and Prisma

Use the Wasp version declared in `main.wasp.ts` and its matching official
documentation. Reference source code with Wasp ref imports. Do not install
`@wasp.sh/spec` from npm; Wasp generates it. Do not edit generated output.
Persisted schema changes require reviewed migrations, data-impact analysis,
rollout, rollback, and focused tests.
